{"4931110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cubara: A Table by the Sea", "steam_appid": 4931110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a tiny deserted island - one palm tree, one tomato seed, and a whale in a chef's hat who insists you have potential. Plant the seed. Build a table at the water's edge. And when the first canoe drifts in and a rabbit orders lunch, you're not a castaway anymore - you're a chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubara is a cozy farming-and-cooking sim about turning that empty beach into a diner worth paddling across an ocean for, one plate at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm the beach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Till the sand, plant a seed, keep it watered - tomatoes, cucumbers, wheat, sweet potatoes. Shake coconuts out of the palm, collect the morning's eggs, catch a worm for bait and cast a line off the shore. Everything you'll ever serve is grown, caught, or picked right here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/3b2723f4336770e0664ecb958b0eb25b.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/3b2723f4336770e0664ecb958b0eb25b.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/3b2723f4336770e0664ecb958b0eb25b.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook every dish by hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcooked-style, minus the panic: chop at the cutting board, build the plate on the sand, grill over a driftwood fire. The menu grows from salads to the morning's catch, pizza, and a mushroom soup a mushroom teaches you herself. And when the plates come back dirty, wash them in the sea. It's fine. It's an island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/34e0908bda476a2c74f804c66ad4b717.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/34e0908bda476a2c74f804c66ad4b717.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/34e0908bda476a2c74f804c66ad4b717.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Serve the canoes at noon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise the flag and watch them come: hungry travelers dock alongside your seaside tables and order lunch without stepping ashore - a fox wants salad, an owl wants grilled fish. Read the ticket, cook the order, carry it out while it's hot, and watch the tips pile up on the sand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/4b92c36ccdbce28da9b6390223ffa7a0.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/4b92c36ccdbce28da9b6390223ffa7a0.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/4b92c36ccdbce28da9b6390223ffa7a0.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage your staff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won't work the lunch rush alone forever. Hire moles, mice, hedgehogs and cats - a waterer for the crops, a fisherman for the shallows, a waiter for the tables, a dishwasher for the shore. Set their routes, upgrade their tools, pay them each night - until the diner hums along without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/4ef146cfd0b2dd74ed7c485c8708bf96.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/4ef146cfd0b2dd74ed7c485c8708bf96.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/4ef146cfd0b2dd74ed7c485c8708bf96.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand the island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save enough shells and the whale raises a brand-new stretch of island out of the sea - and there's always a surprise standing on it: a new neighbor, a new shop, a new secret. Every island grows in its own order, so you never know what surfaces next. More land, more crops, more tables - and one day, a critic in a top hat will take notes and decide to award you a Michelin star. Who knows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/f16d43d6da8c32d1939529912801f6cc.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/f16d43d6da8c32d1939529912801f6cc.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/f16d43d6da8c32d1939529912801f6cc.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill - no pressure, really</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the last guest sails home, the evening is yours: surf the break, find a constellation through the telescope, or just fall asleep in the hammock. And whatever happens -</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No fail state.</strong> No combat, no death, no rot, no debt. A wrong dish still pays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want a day off?</strong> Lower the flag and the canoes sail on by. The island is all yours today.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your pace.</strong> Nobody on this island is in a hurry - including you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/542ee782733022fee2652f6acc6e1164.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/542ee782733022fee2652f6acc6e1164.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/542ee782733022fee2652f6acc6e1164.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend along in online co-op: you run the kitchen, they work the tables, and the lunch rush is suddenly half as long and twice as loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/17c720efc951d1c756eaf5e89dea3abe.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/17c720efc951d1c756eaf5e89dea3abe.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/17c720efc951d1c756eaf5e89dea3abe.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy first-person farming, fishing, and cooking on a tiny island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salads, grilled fish, pizza, and soup - grown, caught, and cooked by hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hireable animal staff with jobs, routes, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island expansions, each with a one-time surprise arrival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Michelin star to earn from a very serious crane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no fail state, nothing burns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English and Hebrew, full RTL support</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone on a tiny deserted island - one palm tree, one tomato seed, and a whale in a chef's hat who insists you have potential. Plant the seed. Build a table at the water's edge. And when the first canoe drifts in and a rabbit orders lunch, you're not a castaway anymore - you're a chef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cubara is a cozy farming-and-cooking sim about turning that empty beach into a diner worth paddling across an ocean for, one plate at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm the beach</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Till the sand, plant a seed, keep it watered - tomatoes, cucumbers, wheat, sweet potatoes. Shake coconuts out of the palm, collect the morning's eggs, catch a worm for bait and cast a line off the shore. Everything you'll ever serve is grown, caught, or picked right here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/3b2723f4336770e0664ecb958b0eb25b.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/3b2723f4336770e0664ecb958b0eb25b.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/3b2723f4336770e0664ecb958b0eb25b.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cook every dish by hand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcooked-style, minus the panic: chop at the cutting board, build the plate on the sand, grill over a driftwood fire. The menu grows from salads to the morning's catch, pizza, and a mushroom soup a mushroom teaches you herself. And when the plates come back dirty, wash them in the sea. It's fine. It's an island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/34e0908bda476a2c74f804c66ad4b717.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/34e0908bda476a2c74f804c66ad4b717.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/34e0908bda476a2c74f804c66ad4b717.mp4?t=1784814404\" typ