\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/4ef146cfd0b2dd74ed7c485c8708bf96.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand the island</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save enough shells and the whale raises a brand-new stretch of island out of the sea - and there's always a surprise standing on it: a new neighbor, a new shop, a new secret. Every island grows in its own order, so you never know what surfaces next. More land, more crops, more tables - and one day, a critic in a top hat will take notes and decide to award you a Michelin star. Who knows?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/f16d43d6da8c32d1939529912801f6cc.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/f16d43d6da8c32d1939529912801f6cc.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/f16d43d6da8c32d1939529912801f6cc.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill - no pressure, really</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the last guest sails home, the evening is yours: surf the break, find a constellation through the telescope, or just fall asleep in the hammock. And whatever happens -</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No fail state.</strong> No combat, no death, no rot, no debt. A wrong dish still pays.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Want a day off?</strong> Lower the flag and the canoes sail on by. The island is all yours today.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your pace.</strong> Nobody on this island is in a hurry - including you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/542ee782733022fee2652f6acc6e1164.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/542ee782733022fee2652f6acc6e1164.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/542ee782733022fee2652f6acc6e1164.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend along in online co-op: you run the kitchen, they work the tables, and the lunch rush is suddenly half as long and twice as loud.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/17c720efc951d1c756eaf5e89dea3abe.poster.avif?t=1784814404\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/17c720efc951d1c756eaf5e89dea3abe.webm?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/extras/17c720efc951d1c756eaf5e89dea3abe.mp4?t=1784814404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy first-person farming, fishing, and cooking on a tiny island</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salads, grilled fish, pizza, and soup - grown, caught, and cooked by hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hireable animal staff with jobs, routes, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island expansions, each with a one-time surprise arrival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Michelin star to earn from a very serious crane</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat, no fail state, nothing burns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English and Hebrew, full RTL support</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Turn your tiny deserted island into a bustling diner in this cozy farming &amp; cooking sim. Hungry travelers sail by and stop at your tables for lunch. Grow crops, fish, grill, and plate every order, hire staff, expand the island, and earn a Michelin star. Play solo or online co-op.", "supported_languages": "English, Hebrew", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/b00ad469d75357ae9fd6537be4152b41db0e540c/header.jpg?t=1784814404", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/6d06649d4b15372933a0eb3e39ac434be5121237/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784814404", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4931110/6d06649d4b15372933a0eb3e39ac434be5121237/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784814404", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3–capable GPU, including integrated (Intel HD 4000+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> ingle-player runs fully offline. Online co-op (cross-platform with the browser version) requires a broadband connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU or modern integrated (Iris Xe / Radeon)<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra (Intel) / macOS 11 Big Sur (Apple Silicon)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3, or Apple Silicon (M1 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any Metal-capable GPU, including integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Universal binary (Intel + Apple Silicon). Single-player runs offline.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 Monterey or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1 or newer) / Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any Metal-capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04+ / SteamOS 3 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3–capable GPU, including integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><s